{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a tiny diver explore the ocean in the corner of your screen while you do other things, or help her out to speed up her progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/803a4432fc557d7484b2953eea1873f6.poster.avif?t=1762067536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/803a4432fc557d7484b2953eea1873f6.webm?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/803a4432fc557d7484b2953eea1873f6.mp4?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 100 different sea creatures to collect across 5 diving locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/482811a86871b1a9f66d17caec1db374.poster.avif?t=1762067536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/482811a86871b1a9f66d17caec1db374.webm?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/482811a86871b1a9f66d17caec1db374.mp4?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your diving gear and become a fashionable diver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/53779e45ad62c705e38a04a18bc18d46.poster.avif?t=1762067536\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/53779e45ad62c705e38a04a18bc18d46.webm?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/extras/53779e45ad62c705e38a04a18bc18d46.mp4?t=1762067536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your diver explores and collects sea creatures automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once in a while, swipe your mouse over boxes she sends to the surface to earn research points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use research points to upgrade diving gear, unlock new outfits, and discover more diving spots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guide your diver through different locations and complete your sea creature collection</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084700?t=1762067536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/5b647c2996fb92835f4dd25d39aaccdbf1f50aa5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762067536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/11b787fb8344ec801cf375e1c9fc286ec2730218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762067536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084700/11b787fb8344ec801cf375e1c9fc286ec2730218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762067536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","